  "sections": {
    "faq": {
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {},
      "blocks": {
        "98a5b991-54d5-4d5e-800f-a9e7fde5e17c": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use multiple promotional codes at one time?",
            "answer": "<p>Unless otherwise stated, we do not permit the usage of multiple promotional codes at one time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "87accb5c-c861-42d1-a3a4-eb00a3cfdf73": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use promotional codes on sale items?",
            "answer": "<p>In most cases yes, we will be sure to notify you if this isn't an option.</p>"
          }
        },
        "bbec5e2f-f7f0-441c-b6aa-ed45411b0229": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where do I enter promotional codes?",
            "answer": "<p><strong>Mobile: </strong>When proceeding to checkout, tap 'Order Summary / Enter Promotional Code'. You will then see a box prompting you to add your promotional code.<br/><br/><strong>Desktop: </strong>The option to use your promotional code is available on the right hand column of the checkout page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "0df7a99e-f265-4c5f-96ca-5881d0d66911": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Head to the product page of your desired item, tap 'JOIN WAITLIST' and then enter your email address or mobile number. Once we restock, an email/SMS will notify you immediately.</p>"
          }
        },
        "4657d1a7-a5bc-4d6f-b6dc-51468672e2b7": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Full payment for your Pre Order is taken upfront at the point of your order being placed. You can cancel at any point and receive a full refund.<br/><br/>Require assistance? Contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and an advisor will be pleased to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a1c48957-70ba-468e-93a4-553569597bcb": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>We will dispatch your in stock item(s) to you within <strong>1-3 Business Days. </strong>Once your Pre Order item(s) arrive in stock, an additional shipment will be made to you.<br/><br/>Require further assistance? Contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and an advisor will be pleased to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "398465bc-e2ba-4e89-b4b3-034199a87245": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Apple Pay, Visa, Visa Debit, Mastercard, PayPal, Klarna, Clearpay, Shop Pay, American<br/>Express, Amazon Pay, Google Pay & DivideBuy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "af932389-04e9-448c-bd12-b87951afa312": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>We physically stocks 1000’s of products in our Cheshire based HQ, all ready to be shipped within 1-3 Business Days. If a product is available to Pre Order, this means that it’s on its way to our HQ, ready to ship as soon as it lands.</p>"
          }
        },
        "060244cf-44e8-4aec-ae16-a112919c5a59": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I order and hold my items in stock for delivery at a later date?"
          }
        },
        "627307f6-e9a8-49b6-bf05-d5835d768f98": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Mainland UK + Northern Ireland is<strong> 100% Free</strong></p>"
          }
        },
        "c85cfe87-887f-40fd-aaee-78a50cd855de": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Overseas delivery is available to Northern Ireland, Ireland, France, Germany, Belgium &  Netherlands. Our team is working actively on increasing the number of countries we ship to. Follow our instagram @williamwood for all announcements.</p>"
          }
        },
        "7d8fc3ec-7ca6-4010-bc53-b95729e58399": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p><strong>Delivery to front entrance of your property</strong><br/><br/>William Wood Dedicated Delivery service will hand deliver your item(s) with the utmost care to the front entrance of your property.<br/><br/><strong>Delivery to specific room of choice within your property </strong><br/><br/>With a large majority of cases, William Wood Dedicated Delivery service will be able to deliver your item(s) to your room of choice. However, upon inspecting the path to your specific room of choice and whether this may be to difficult, this decision will be at the William Wood Dedicated Delivery drivers discretion.<br/><br/><strong>To clarify, in a vast majority of cases William Wood Dedicated Delivery will be able to deliver to your room of choice.</strong><br/><br/>Require further assistance? Contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and an advisor will be pleased to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "860f5b4b-294c-4e2b-81b5-150fd0143cf0": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Please update us of any address changes within <strong>24 hours</strong> of your order being placed. Contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and an advisor will be pleased to assist you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "22e566ca-c21b-4cba-aab0-0589bccb819a": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p><strong>IN STOCK ITEM(S) DELIVERY<br/><br/>UK Mainland:</strong> Usually dispatched in <strong>1-3 Business Days</strong><br/><br/><strong>Northern Ireland:</strong> 7-21 Business Days (some small items 1-2 Business Days, please see product page information)</p><p><strong>Netherlands: </strong>7-21 Business Days<br/><br/><strong>France:</strong> 7-21 Business Days North France</p><p><strong>Germany: </strong></p><p>7-21 Business Days Leitzone 4, 5, 6</p><p>7-28 Business Days Leitzone 0, 1, 2, 3, 7, 8, 9<br/><br/><br/><strong>PRE ORDER ITEM(S) DELIVERY<br/><br/></strong>Your <strong>Pre Order </strong>item(s) will be delivered to you with the utmost urgency within the advised shipping week on the product page. You can easily locate the shipping week below the <strong>'ADD TO BAG' </strong>button.<br/><br/>Our highly acclaimed Pre Order service is available for customers who wish to purchase and reserve in demand stock.<br/> </p><p>Pre Orders can be Cancelled anytime. 100% refund guarantee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "21f1e1ec-aa78-42b5-92cf-d5e292e67ed2": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>We don't offer order tracking yet, however you will be provided the contact number for your William Wood Dedicated Delivery driver should you wish to contact them at any point.<br/><br/>Our logistics team also provide frequent updates via phone and text, ensuring you aer kept fully up to date.</p>"
          }
        },
        "04087f38-d5c7-4805-b0e2-e7111cd8d05e": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Should you wish to exchange your order, we are more than happy to offer this service to you for <strong>Free</strong>.<br/><br/>For more information on exchanges, please contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cfad3789-f38a-43c3-bbde-6934ac4ffb7d": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>We offer <strong>90 Days Free Returns </strong>on all orders. To start a return, head to your <strong>Customer Portal </strong>and select 'Request a return'. Our Customer Support Team will review this request and once accepted produce a collection for your item(s). <br/>or<br/>Contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and our team will be more than happy to assist you.<br/><br/>To login to your Customer Portal please use the same email address that you used when placing your order. We will then text your a one-time 6 digit passcode to gain access.<br/><br/><strong>Customer Portal Location<br/><br/></strong>Desktop: Top right header menu<br/>Mobile: Bottom left slide out menu</p>"
          }
        },
        "832eb028-7f4f-4a6a-80e2-9e10a7d2e411": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>You retain full control of your order with us at all times. Contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and an advisor will be pleased to assist you with your request.</p>"
          }
        },
        "17874198-cc63-4c92-8973-05298aee5804": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Please contact our Customer Support Team via <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk </strong>and an advisor will be pleased to assist you with your request.</p>"
          }
        }
      }
    },
